1.3 Create an Order in Server
Order is an important step in the payment process.
- An order should be created for every payment.
- You can create an order using the [Orders API](https://razorpay.com/docs/payments/payment-gateway/android-integration/standard/integration-steps#api-sample-code). It is a server-side API call. Know how to [authenticate](https://razorpay.com/docs/payments/dashboard/account-settings/api-keys/#generate-api-keys) Orders API.
